OL,3,GNEWSAMan who drugged and raped wife
OL,4,Asaid he understood consent, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who drugged and raped his wife
OL,7,Ffor more than 20 years told an online
OL,8,Fcontact he "understands consent", a
OL,9,Fjury has heard.
OL,11,FThe husband pleaded guilty in September
OL,12,Fto 60 offences against the woman
OL,13,Fincluding rape, administering a
OL,14,Fsubstance with intent and sharing
OL,15,Findecent images without her consent.
OL,17,FThe prosecution said that from 2023 the
OL,18,Fhusband invited other men to the
OL,19,Fcouple's home, where, it is alleged, he
OL,20,Fand others sexually abused her while
OL,21,Fshe was unconscious and "out of it".
