OL,6,FThe man, who is in 60s, from Stockport,
OL,7,FGreater Manchester, cannot be
OL,8,Fidentified to protect his wife's
OL,9,Fanonymity. He will give evidence later
OL,10,Fthis month against nine men on trial at
OL,11,FManchester Minshull Street Crown Court.
